[87.7514, "o", "\r\u001b[2K```\r\ngrep -nE \r\n'^\\[|^(site_owner|noreply_address|layout|var_dir|queue_dir|bin_dir|data_dir|log_dir|lock_dir|etc_dir|pid_file|smtp|transport|mail_host|admin|base_url|web|databa\r\nse|class|host|port|url|password|path|user|runner|start|subscription|post|archive|mta|incoming|outgoing|smtp_host|smtp_port|smtp_user|smtp_pass)' \r\n/etc/mailman3/mailman.cfg | head -200; echo '--- cfg size'; wc -l /etc/mailman3/mailman.cfg; echo '--- full'; nl -ba /etc/mailman3/mailman.cfg | sed -n \r\n'100,320p'\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠋\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
