[107.823268, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\r\n\u001b[1;31mmini-swe-agent\u001b[0m\u001b[31m (step \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m9\u001b[0m\u001b[31m, \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m$0.00\u001b[0m\u001b[31m):\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m⠋\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond...\r\u001b[2K```\r\npython3 - <<'PY'\r\nfrom mailman.interfaces.mailinglist import SubscriptionPolicy\r\nprint(list(SubscriptionPolicy))\r\nfor x in SubscriptionPolicy: print(x, x.value)\r\nPY\r\ngrep -R \"subscription_policy\" -n /usr/lib/python3/dist-packages/mailman | head -80\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠋\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond...\r\u001b[2K\u001b[32m⠋\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond...\r\n\u001b[?25h\r\u001b[1A\u001b[2K"]
