[153.925273, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\r\n\u001b[1;31mmini-swe-agent\u001b[0m\u001b[31m (step \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m15\u001b[0m\u001b[31m, \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m$0.00\u001b[0m\u001b[31m):\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m⠸\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[153.926865, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\u001b[32m⠸\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[153.927681, "o", "\r\u001b[2KI’ll first configure Postfix to accept `local.edu` local users and route Mailman list addresses to Mailman’s LMTP server, then initialize Mailman and create the\r\nlist with the required policies.\r\n\r\n```\r\nset -e\r\ncp -a /etc/mailman3/mailman.cfg /etc/mailman3/mailman.cfg.orig\r\ncp -a /etc/postfix/main.cf /etc/postfix/main.cf.orig\r\n# Basic identity and local domain handling\r\necho local.edu > /etc/mailname\r\npostconf -e 'myhostname = local.edu'\r\npostconf -e 'mydomain = local.edu'\r\npostconf -e 'myorigin = /etc/mailname'\r\npostconf -e 'mydestination = $myhostname, localhost, localhost.localdomain, local.edu'\r\n# Send Mailman list traffic to Mailman's LMTP listener\r\npostconf -e 'transport_maps = hash:/var/lib/mailman3/data/postfix_lmtp'\r\npostconf -e 'local_recipient_maps = proxy:unix:passwd.byname $alias_maps'\r\npostconf -e 'mailbox_size_limit = 0'\r\n# Fix Mailman runtime ownership (some dirs were created by root during setup/tests)\r\nmkdir -p /var/lib/mailman3/data /var/lib/mailman3/locks /var/lib/mailman3/queue\r\nchown -R list:list /var/lib/mailman3 /var/log/mailman3 /run/mailman3\r\nchmod 755 /var/lib/mailman3\r\n# Configure Mailman's MTA integration explicitly in mailman.cfg\r\npython3 - <<'PY'\r\nfrom pathlib import Path\r\np = Path('/etc/mailman3/mailman.cfg')\r\ns = p.read_text()\r\ns = s.replace('site_owner: changeme@example.com', 'site_owner: postmaster@local.edu')\r\n# Ensure MTA settings are exactly as needed.\r\ns = s.replace('incoming: mailman.mta.exim4.LMTP\\n#incoming: mailman.mta.postfix.LMTP',\r\n              'incoming: mailman.mta.postfix.LMTP')\r\nif 'incoming: mailman.mta.postfix.LMTP' not in s:\r\n    s = s.replace('#incoming: mailman.mta.exim4.LMTP\\n#incoming: mailman.mta.postfix.LMTP',\r\n                  'incoming: mailman.mta.postfix.LMTP')\r\ns = s.replace('#incoming: mailman.mta.exim4.LMTP\\nincoming: mailman.mta.postfix.LMTP',\r\n              'incoming: mailman.mta.postfix.LMTP')\r\n# Make sure configuration line remains postfix config module.\r\ns = s.replace('#configuration: python:mailman.config.exim4\\nconfiguration: python:mailman.config.postfix',\r\n        "]
[153.928434, "o", "      'configuration: python:mailman.config.postfix')\r\np.write_text(s)\r\nPY\r\ngrep -nE '^site_owner|^incoming|^configuration|^lmtp_host|^lmtp_port|^smtp_host|^smtp_port' /etc/mailman3/mailman.cfg\r\necho '--- postconf'; postconf -n | grep -E '^(myhostname|mydomain|myorigin|mydestination|transport_maps|local_recipient_maps|mailbox_size_limit) '\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠸\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[153.929264, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\u001b[32m⠸\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond...\r\n\u001b[?25h\r\u001b[1A\u001b[2K"]
[155.897129, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;32mTool\u001b[0m:\r\n"]
[155.898074, "o", "<returncode>\r\n0\r\n<output>\r\n28:site_owner: postmaster@local.edu\r\n243:incoming: mailman.mta.postfix.LMTP\r\n252:smtp_host: localhost\r\n253:smtp_port: 25\r\n260:lmtp_host: 127.0.0.1\r\n261:lmtp_port: 8024\r\n269:configuration: python:mailman.config.postfix\r\n--- postconf\r\nlocal_recipient_maps = proxy:unix:passwd.byname $alias_maps\r\nmailbox_size_limit = 0\r\nmydestination = $myhostname, localhost, localhost.localdomain, local.edu\r\nmydomain = local.edu\r\nmyhostname = local.edu\r\nmyorigin = /etc/mailname\r\ntransport_maps = hash:/var/lib/mailman3/data/postfix_lmtp\r\n\r\n"]
[155.901316, "o", "\u001b[92m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[?25l"]
