[159.494463, "o", "\r\u001b[2K```\r\nset -x\r\nservice postfix start || true\r\nservice postfix status || true\r\npostfix check || true\r\nrunuser -u list -- mailman -C /etc/mailman3/mailman.cfg create reading-group@local.edu -o postmaster@local.edu --notify 2>&1 || true\r\nmailman --run-as-root -C /etc/mailman3/mailman.cfg lists 2>&1 || true\r\nls -l /var/lib/mailman3/data\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠸\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond...\r\u001b[2K\u001b[32m⠸\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond...\r\n\u001b[?25h\r\u001b[1A\u001b[2K"]
